        "end": 416,
        "quote": "Cervical cancer cell lines were treated with 1uM cisplatin followed by 1-6Gy ionizing radiation (IR). CaSki cells with PIK3CA E545K mutation show resistance to cisplatin plus IR when compared with HeLa or SiHa cells that express only wild-type PIK3CA. Transfection of HeLa cells with PIK3CA E545K resulted in resistance to cisplatin plus IR compared to cells expressing only wild-type PIK3CA or with PIK3CA depleted."
